{"duration_api_ms":231972,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6505b1d2-6949-4329-a9a7-a7de12d2f19f","total_cost_usd":0.274958,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15126,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":21445,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16503},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15126,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":21445,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15126,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15126},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":21445,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15126,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.274958,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":16503,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The feasible front is a one-parameter curve in flight_path_angle at the corner D≈3.38, bluntness 1.2, cone 70. Along it, peak flux runs 227.7k to 275.2k W/m2 and bondline T runs 418.0 K to 391.1 K. Three limits pin that corner. Peak g <= 12 caps gamma near -3.572. Heatshield mass fraction caps D near 3.385. The cd_fore surrogate hull caps bluntness at about 1.2 for cone about 70. Every other explored region is either dominated or infeasible on max_g or mass fraction. Little hypervolume is left to gain, so I fill the remaining gaps on the curve with a slightly larger D and probe the edges.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-d67ebd910866 to C-fe69bc352dbe: the D=3.38, b=1.2, cone 69.9-70 family, gamma -1.5 to -3.57, is the whole front. T falls monotonically and flux rises with steeper gamma.\",\"C-fe69bc352dbe versus C-32c1a76f8425: D 3.380 to 3.383 lowers flux 275180 to 274820 and T 391.18 to 391.12. g rises about 0.002. The mass margin falls 0.003055 to 0.001284, about -0.59 per metre of D, so D is capped near 3.385.\",\"C-41b2ddb7397c, C-43b18404f13e, C-6cbef4d15c79: lowering b from 1.2 to 1.1 raises flux 273.5k to 278.2k and cuts the mass margin to 0.00015. Bluntness 1.2 is best.\",\"C-3d41ce848a30, C-dcc9bfd9f503, C-2375647d7e43, C-bcce2808c9b8, C-a554636d8035: b=1.21 at cone 70 or 69.9, and b=1.2 at cone 69.0, fail the cd_fore hull. The usable corner is roughly b<=1.2, cone>=69.5.\",\"C-602600f85327: D=3.2, gamma -4.2 gives g 13.0, so g is driven mainly by gamma with only a weak D effect. C-02335773, C-2d91d8d713d7, C-c97855c2d790 show steeper gamma is infeasible on g.\"],\"mechanism\":\"This relies partly on prior Allen-Eggers-type reasoning, calibrated to the data. Peak g in a ballistic-type entry is set mainly by gamma and hardly by geometry, so gamma is capped near -3.57. Flux falls with nose radius and area (about D^-1.4 here, from the C-fe69bc352dbe/C-32c1a76f8425 pair), and bondline T falls with heat load, which is lower for larger D and steeper gamma. The mass-fraction constraint stops D growing past about 3.385, and the hull stops b growing past about 1.2. The best design therefore stays at the corner and moves along gamma. Raising D to 3.384-3.385 gives about -0.17 to -0.2% flux and -0.07 K everywhere, a small gain. The remaining slots sample gamma gaps and probe hull edges.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The gains available are small, about 1e-4 to 1e-3 of normalised hypervolume. The mass margin at D=3.384-3.385 is only about 0.0001-0.0008, and the g margin at gamma about -3.57 is about 1e-4, so feasibility is marginal. I extrapolate the D dependence of g and mass margin linearly from two or three close points. The hull probes at b=1.205 and cone 69.6 could return a no-geometry failure. Predicted flux and T are interpolations of the front, with an assumed -0.17% flux and -0.07 K shift for D=3.384.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-d67ebd910866\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow end of the front with D raised to 3.384 for a small flux and T gain.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227320,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the D=3.384 mass margin and the size of the gain at the shallow end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d67ebd910866\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.6 and -1.8 at D=3.384.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":231340,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.65,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"A front point in a sparsely sampled gamma interval.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d67ebd910866\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.8 and -1.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.85},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":234460,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":412.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front at slightly better D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d67ebd910866\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.1 and -2.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":242190,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the mid front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d67ebd910866\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.4 and -2.6.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":249130,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the mid front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d67ebd910866\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.6 and -2.8.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":253840,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the mid front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d67ebd910866\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.8 and -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":258600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the mid front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.0 and -3.1.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.05},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":262200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep-end front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.1 and -3.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":265810,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep-end front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.25 and -3.35.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":268210,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep-end front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.35 and -3.45.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":270620,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep-end front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.45 and -3.5 at D=3.384.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.475},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272420,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep-end front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Near the g cap, at gamma -3.55 with D=3.384, expecting g about 11.97.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273970,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.25,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Steep-end front point with a comfortable g margin.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Steepest-gamma corner point at D=3.384. It should dominate C-fe69bc352dbe, but the g margin is about 1e-4.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether the extreme corner point improves on C-fe69bc352dbe and whether g stays at or below 12. A high-fidelity check may be worthwhile because the g margin is thin.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Push D to 3.385 at gamma -3.45. This probes the mass-fraction edge, with predicted margin about 0.00015.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271690,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the exact mass-fraction limit in D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Steepest gamma at D=3.38, where g is predicted about 11.999.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.572},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":275220,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.16,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the g=12 boundary in gamma with the mass margin left intact.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Hull probe: bluntness 1.205 at cone 70. b=1.21 failed, and a small b increase would lower flux by about 0.2%.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.205},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272470,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the cd_fore hull boundary in bluntness. It may return a no-geometry failure.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Hull probe: cone 69.6 at b=1.2. Cone 69.0 failed and 69.9 passed, and the cone has almost no effect on flux, T or mass margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273020,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the hull boundary in cone angle and confirms the weak cone dependence.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"Corner point at D=3.385, gamma -3.57. Predicted g about 11.999 and mass margin about 0.0001.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274570,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests both the g and mass-fraction limits at the extreme corner. A high-fidelity check is worthwhile because both margins are thin.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1}]}","ttft_ms":194327,"type":"result","duration_ms":232016,"uuid":"96b3b340-bbb4-4b0b-9a19-0f200043ffa5","ttft_stream_ms":1674,"time_to_request_ms":41,"first_content_frame_ms":1675,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
